<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20288] LASSERT fails in ksocknal_close_conn_locked with IPv6</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20288</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In ksocknal_close_conn_locked, we have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;LASSERT(conn-&amp;gt;ksnc_proto == &amp;amp;ksocknal_protocol_v3x);&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But when we have IPv6, &lt;b&gt;ksnc_proto&lt;/b&gt; is &lt;b&gt;ksocknal_protocol_v4x&lt;/b&gt;, so assert fails.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
